# JARVIS Task Register

## Governance note

Statuses: `TODO`, `IN_PROGRESS`, `WAITING_APPROVAL`, `COMPLETED`, `FAILED`, `CANCELLED`.

This register distinguishes current work from future tasks and does not imply completion for tasks that are only planned.

## LOCKED

- Every new task requires a small scope, dependencies, expected files, acceptance criteria, and an explicit status transition.
- No task may be marked completed without verification against source and tests.
- Future work must remain labeled as future, not current.

