## FUTURE

Future work beyond the current roadmap includes fully provider-backed automation, production data integration, the general scheduler, and voice. These items remain future until their acceptance gates are verified in source and tests.

## Summary

The current task register reflects a verified baseline and a proposed roadmap. Tasks in the future lane should not be treated as implemented work or as evidence that platform capabilities are already available.
